SUMMARY:Civic Meetup #551: SolveTO: From one pothole\, to a reporting
  platform for every Canadian city - by Civic Tech Toronto
LOCATION:available upon registration\, and virtual (hybrid)
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://guild.host/events/civic-meetup-551-solveto-i4v3p9\n\nHosted by
  Civic Tech Toronto (https://civictech.ca/)\n\nCivic Tech Toronto's weekly
  civic meetups bring together Torontonians who share an interest in making
  Toronto more responsive\, prosperous\, sustainable\, and equitable
  through design\, tech\, and data. This week\, hear from Ahmed Nadar about
  how he built a tool that turns one photo of a pothole he drove by daily
  for months into a report the city can act on. Followed by breakout
  groups.
END:VEVENT
